id: pm-2irc1p
title: "GH-865: classify linked-test lock contention as infrastructure collision"
description: Linked tests that fail because another process holds a tool or filesystem lock are currently classified as assertion_failure. Recognize narrow lock-acquisition timeout and already-running evidence as retryable infra_collision without weakening real assertion classification.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[6]: "area:sdk","area:testing",classification,github-report,linked-tests,reliability
created_at: "2026-08-02T06:47:21.892Z"
