comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-02T06:47:21.892Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: searched all open, closed, and canceled PM items for failure_category, infra_collision, assertion_failure, linked test lock, lock acquisition timeout, and already running; adjacent lock and test items do not own failure classification. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/865."
  "2026-08-02T07:13:26.958Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: linked-test failure classification now recognizes compound acquisition+contention lock failures while retaining generic lock/timeout assertion text as assertion_failure."
  "2026-08-02T11:28:20.952Z","harness:codex","Repository-wide verification: 418 test files and 6,703 tests passed under the sandboxed coverage runner with exact 100% statements (47,529/47,529), branches (34,246/34,246), functions (9,673/9,673), and lines (46,119/46,119). No coverage thresholds, exclusions, or ignore counts were weakened."
  "2026-08-02T11:35:47.576Z","harness:codex","Packed-consumer acceptance: pnpm smoke:npx passed the generated tarball across 15 packaged modules. An independent tarball was then installed from unrelated root /tmp/tmp.0PKR29g4Dz into separate npm and Bun consumers with isolated project/global trackers; both initialized, created items, added evidence, and returned files lookup total=1. npm additionally proved atomic files/docs replacement and exact repeated evidence changed=false."
  "2026-08-02T12:21:49.572Z","harness:codex","Hosted acceptance: exact head fd69b84335ead8ef1022b606a470166e78c9f188 passed nightly run 30747290823 on Windows Node 24, macOS Node 24, and Ubuntu Node 22/24/25. Ubuntu Node 24 also passed secret scan, exact 100% coverage, static quality, and compatibility migration gates."
  "2026-08-02T12:58:07.725Z","harness:codex","PR #872 review correction: compound lock acquisition and contention evidence must occur on the same output line; multiline false-positive regression added. CodeRabbit comment 3699054655 was verified as valid."
  "2026-08-02T13:08:08.325Z","harness:codex","Exact-head review-correction verification: 418 test files and 6,704 tests passed with exact 100% statements (47,540/47,540), branches (34,248/34,248), functions (9,675/9,675), and lines (46,130/46,130). The first run's 99.99% branch result exposed and removed an impossible join fallback rather than weakening the gate."
